<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<div class="page-head">
  <h1>System</h1>
  <p>The mechanical details, and how to apply changes.</p>
</div>

<div class="panel summary">
  <div class="panel-body flush">
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><div class="n mono t-lg"><%= version %></div><div class="l">version</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="n"><%= uptime < 90 ? uptime + 's' : Math.floor(uptime / 60) + 'm' %></div><div class="l">uptime</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="n mono t-lg"><%= channel %></div><div class="l">channel</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="n mono t-lg"><%= queueDriver %></div><div class="l">queue</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="n"><%= Math.round(memory.rss / 1048576) %>MB</div><div class="l">memory</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2 class="section">Applying changes</h2>
<div class="panel">
  <div class="panel-body">
    <% if (pending.length) { %>
      <p><b><%= pending.length %> setting<%= pending.length === 1 ? '' : 's' %> changed since <%= branding.botName %> started.</b>
         Most settings are read once at startup, so they take effect when you restart.</p>
      <div class="langs">
        <% pending.forEach(function (p) { %><span class="lang alt"><%= p.key %></span><% }) %>
      </div>
    <% } else { %>
      <p class="muted">Nothing is waiting. What is saved is what is running.</p>
    <% } %>

    <div class="banner info gap-md">
      <div class="grow">
        <b>There is no restart button, on purpose</b>
        On a laptop <%= branding.botName %> runs in your terminal, and a button that stopped it could not start
        it again. On Railway the restart policy is <code>ON_FAILURE</code>, so a clean exit would stop the
        service rather than restart it. Instead:
        <div class="gap-sm">
          <div class="small">On your own machine — press <b>Ctrl+C</b> in the terminal running it, then <code>rumi start</code>.</div>
          <div class="small">On Railway — press <b>Restart</b> on the service.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2 class="section">Where things are</h2>
<div class="panel">
  <div class="wrap-x">
  <table class="grid">
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Settings file</td><td class="mono"><%= envPath %></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Node</td><td class="mono"><%= node %></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Environment</td><td class="mono"><%= nodeEnv %></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Console access</td><td class="mono"><%= posture.mode %> — <%= posture.reason %></td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/foot') %>
